                                "$$ 4x = 20 \\rightarrow x = 5 $$",
                                "$x = 5$ を第2式に代入: $5 - 2y = 4 \\rightarrow y = \\frac{1}{2}$",
                                "答え: $x = 5, y = \\frac{1}{2}$"
